5
00:00:10,072 --> 00:00:12,080
across star systems took place.

6
00:00:14,016 --> 00:00:16,039
The Blood Ancestor crossed star systems

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,055
and came to the Thunder Celestial Realm.

8
00:00:19,092 --> 00:00:21,011
A mighty being's rage

9
00:00:21,056 --> 00:00:23,019
spilled endless blood.

10
00:00:24,016 --> 00:00:25,031
In the depths of despair,

11
00:00:25,068 --> 00:00:28,031
Wang Lin received help from his friend Li Yuan

12
00:00:28,084 --> 00:00:30,079
and by borrowing the laws of the heavens and the earth,

13
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:33,035
he fought the Blood Ancestor to the death.

14
00:00:34,076 --> 00:00:36,099
It was a certain death battle

15
00:00:37,052 --> 00:00:41,011
but he ended up slaying the Immortal against all odds.

16
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:52,060
Renegade Immortal Movie\N\NBattle of the Immortal Slayer

17
00:00:47,044 --> 00:00:52,060
Stay tuned

18
00:01:05,076 --> 00:01:10,076
The rules keep changing.

19
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:19,060
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

20
00:01:23,076 --> 00:01:30,004
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

21
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:38,068
I am resolved to sever this flood

22
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:45,004
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

23
00:01:45,028 --> 00:01:49,040
from loneliness and distinction.

24
00:01:49,088 --> 00:01:54,036
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

25
00:01:54,056 --> 00:01:59,036
Don't fall down.

26
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,056
I look towards the top.

27
00:02:02,064 --> 00:02:05,020
Chase !

28
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:08,040
Refined to perfection.

29
00:02:09,096 --> 00:02:14,032
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

30
00:02:14,044 --> 00:02:17,036
I dare to defy the heavens !

31
00:02:17,084 --> 00:02:21,020
Always overcome the obstacles,

32
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:23,056
ignite the seas with blood,

33
00:02:23,072 --> 00:02:28,000
bloom through trials and tribulations.

34
00:02:28,016 --> 00:02:32,064
Even the sharpest thorns

35
00:02:32,076 --> 00:02:37,020
will be reduced into ashes.

36
00:02:37,024 --> 00:02:41,052
What is there to fear ?

37
00:02:46,052 --> 00:02:50,068
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

