00:04:06,044 --> 00:04:09,066
Void between Thunder\NCelestial Realm fragments

40
00:04:13,004 --> 00:04:15,004
Yan Chou\NGuard of the Yao Family\NIllusory Yin

41
00:04:13,004 --> 00:04:15,004
Ru Yun\NYao Lao's cousin\NEarly stage Ascendant

42
00:04:13,004 --> 00:04:15,004
Yao Luo\NYao Family's branch member\NPeak Late stage Ascendant

43
