85
00:07:34,060 --> 00:07:36,015
Spatial Bending !?

86
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,012
I know all the Corporeal Yang cultivators who entered the Thunder Celestial Realm,

87
00:07:40,016 --> 00:07:41,055
