94
00:08:31,072 --> 00:08:33,063
How long did you chase my friend ?

95
00:08:32,096 --> 00:08:34,095
Senior, let me speak !

96
00:08:34,096 --> 00:08:36,011
It was the Yao Young Master...

97
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,099
How long !?

98
00:08:39,052 --> 00:08:40,024
Thir...

99
00:08:40,052 --> 00:08:41,095
Thirteen days...

100
00:08:42,044 --> 00:08:42,083
Stop !

101
00:08:45,024 --> 00:08:46,072
This is for the first day.

102
00:08:47,092 --> 00:08:48,089
The second day !

103
00:08:50,092 --> 00:08:51,079
The third day !

104
00:08:54,084 --> 00:08:55,052
Stop !

105
00:08:55,088 --> 00:08:57,027
The fourth day !

106
00:08:58,008 --> 00:08:58,087
Fifth...

107
00:08:59,044 --> 00:09:00,024
Sixth...

108
00:09:00,056 --> 00:09:01,011
Seventh !

109
00:09:02,084 --> 00:09:04,003
Thirteenth !

110
00:09:07,072 --> 00:09:08,068
Junior,

111
00:09:09,048 --> 00:09:11,044
