112
00:09:11,088 --> 00:09:14,055
The Yao Family will exterminate your entire family !

113
00:09:16,056 --> 00:09:17,071
Do you recognize him ?

114
00:09:21,020 --> 00:09:23,083
The aura of the Yao Family's direct bloodline ?

115
00:09:24,076 --> 00:09:25,055
You...!

116
00:09:32,092 --> 00:09:33,043
Brother Li,

117
00:09:33,084 --> 00:09:34,083
I will give you an opportunity.

118
00:09:36,036 --> 00:09:38,000
Whether you can reach Illusory Yin

119
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,079
depends on your luck.

120
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:47,052
Cave Residence\NThunder Celestial Realm

121
00:09:47,004 --> 00:09:49,053
Li Yuan has been stuck at Peak Ascendant for years

122
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,091
not because he lacks talent

123
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:53,027
but because he lacked origin energy.

124
00:09:54,076 --> 00:09:56,023
By infusing him with origin energy today,

125
00:09:57,028 --> 00:09:58,067
he may be able to breakthrough.

126
00:10:02,092 --> 00:10:03,087
In such a short time,

127
00:10:04,064 --> 00:10:06,096
I was hunted by an all-powerful Nirvana Cleanser.

128
00:10:07,044 --> 00:10:09,060
Had I chosen to flee and avoid the fight that day,

129
00:10:09,096 --> 00:10:11,068
I would have likely become a blood slave

130
00:10:11,096 --> 00:10:13,064
or have died with my Dao exterminated.

131
00:10:14,092 --> 00:10:15,095
To slay this Immortal,

132
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,055
