136
00:10:33,056 --> 00:10:34,087
The Corporeal Yang realm

137
00:10:35,016 --> 00:10:36,064
is not only a higher cultivation level

138
00:10:36,072 --> 00:10:39,084
but it also grants a higher mastery over the laws of the world.

139
00:10:43,096 --> 00:10:46,040
Refining an entire Celestial Realm fragment into an artifact

140
00:10:47,016 --> 00:10:48,051
really made this trip worthwile.

141
00:10:51,044 --> 00:10:54,040
Thunder Celestial Realm\NFragment Stamp

142
00:10:56,044 --> 00:10:56,099
Wan'er...

143
00:10:57,096 --> 00:10:58,067
Wait for me.

144
00:11:00,032 --> 00:11:02,007
I will definitely go to Planet Dong Lin.

145
00:11:02,072 --> 00:11:04,079
Even if there is only a sliver of a chance to awaken you,

146
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,011
I will not let it go.

147
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,075
Before going to Dong Lin,

148
00:11:14,044 --> 00:11:16,043
I still need to master more celestial spells and artifacts.

149
00:11:18,012 --> 00:11:20,064
This object is formed from half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body,

150
00:11:20,072 --> 00:11:21,067
it's very powerful.

151
00:11:22,088 --> 00:11:23,084
If I refine it a bit,

152
00:11:24,052 --> 00:11:25,035
it may save my life

153
00:11:25,052 --> 00:11:26,051
