154
00:11:38,004 --> 00:11:39,031
This artifact isn't ordinary.

155
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,051
I have tried several times

156
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,063
but I can't imprint my Divine Sense on it.

157
00:11:45,044 --> 00:11:47,036
Could there be another secret to it ?

158
00:11:50,076 --> 00:11:51,087
When I obtained this bone,

159
00:11:52,048 --> 00:11:54,031
it was with these celestial swords.

160
00:12:05,096 --> 00:12:06,084
As expected !

161
00:12:11,084 --> 00:12:13,052
The celestial swords and the beast bone

162
00:12:13,092 --> 00:12:16,042
are able to make a faintly perceptible formation.

163
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:18,011
If not for this nested formation,

164
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,031
my Divine Sense would have no way in.

165
00:12:35,028 --> 00:12:37,076
A restriction world was hidden in the sword ?

166
00:12:59,096 --> 00:13:01,027
This restriction is brilliant,

167
00:13:01,048 --> 00:13:02,087
it's unlike anything I've ever seen.

168
00:13:02,096 --> 00:13:04,075
The one who set it is no ordinary Celestial.

169
00:13:05,072 --> 00:13:06,093
To claim this artifact,

170
00:13:07,024 --> 00:13:08,031
I must find the formation's eye

171
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,075
to break the restriction.

172
00:13:22,044 --> 00:13:23,023
I found it !

173
00:13:44,016 --> 00:13:45,043
All these restrictions

174
00:13:46,012 --> 00:13:47,032
are chained together

175
00:13:47,032 --> 00:13:48,056
in a restriction matrix.

176
00:13:49,068 --> 00:13:50,087
To imprint my Divine Sense,

177
00:13:51,092 --> 00:13:52,055
I need to

178
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:54,087
break all the restrictions at once !

179
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,056
Fall !

180
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:25,052
Withered Dao Pair

181
00:14:24,068 --> 00:14:26,099
According to the memory of the previous Divine Sense imprint,

182
00:14:27,016 --> 00:14:28,008
this thing

183
00:14:28,020 --> 00:14:29,039
is called the Withered Dao Pair.

184
00:14:30,004 --> 00:14:31,071
It's a true celestial artifact.

185
00:14:32,092 --> 00:14:34,075
It was damaged in the war against the Ancient Gods.

186
00:14:35,036 --> 00:14:36,059
After its master died,

187
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,075
it wasn't fully repaired.

188
00:14:41,036 --> 00:14:42,072
Even in its damaged state,

189
00:14:42,088 --> 00:14:44,031
its power is still astonishing.

190
00:14:46,096 --> 00:14:49,055
It's one of my most powerful artifacts right now.

191
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:55,024
Yao

192
00:14:53,044 --> 00:14:54,051
Yao Family of Allheaven...

193
00:14:55,076 --> 00:14:57,003
Ever since I killed the Blood Ancestor,

194
00:14:57,076 --> 00:14:59,019
