195
00:15:02,056 --> 00:15:03,063
Another talisman ?

196
00:15:05,044 --> 00:15:06,023
This talisman

197
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:09,003
is extremely similar to the one I obtained from Xu Fenghan.

198
00:15:09,006 --> 00:15:11,012
Note: Xu Fengshan, Illusory Yin from Planet Dong Lin (episode 149)

199
00:15:11,016 --> 00:15:12,036
Origin energy fluctuations !

200
00:15:13,008 --> 00:15:14,032
If not for my improved cultivation,

201
00:15:14,036 --> 00:15:15,056
I wouldn't have detected it.

202
00:15:16,024 --> 00:15:17,067
This should be a special artifact

203
00:15:18,044 --> 00:15:19,083
but I don't know how to use it for now.

204
00:15:25,092 --> 00:15:26,087
Collection Pavilion...

205
00:15:28,084 --> 00:15:31,040
So this Illusory Yin Elder entered the Thunder Celestial Realm

206
00:15:31,068 --> 00:15:33,091
to escort a member of the Yao Family to this pavilion

207
00:15:34,072 --> 00:15:35,083
to obtain celestial spells.

208
00:15:37,048 --> 00:15:40,000
This pavilion was personally built by the Thunder Celestial Emperor

209
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,084
and stores countless celestial spells.

210
00:15:42,060 --> 00:15:45,003
Now, the four great ancient families with a Celestial bloodline

211
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:46,087
have joined forces to seal this place

212
00:15:47,032 --> 00:15:48,091
and only allow those with a Celestial bloodline to enter

213
00:15:49,048 --> 00:15:50,055
in search of opportunities.

214
00:15:52,032 --> 00:15:53,014
The Yao Family

215
00:15:54,012 --> 00:15:55,011
is one of them.

216
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,015
Brother Xu,

217
00:16:04,012 --> 00:16:04,075
thank you.

218
00:16:05,088 --> 00:16:08,035
But my Origin Soul can't withstand that much origin energy.

219
00:16:08,084 --> 00:16:09,083
It seems that

220
00:16:10,052 --> 00:16:12,020
I'm not fated to reach Illusory Yin.

221
00:16:14,028 --> 00:16:15,084
Brother Li, don't underestimate yourself.

222
00:16:16,056 --> 00:16:19,000
The origin energy within you will keep nourishing your Origin Soul.

223
00:16:19,028 --> 00:16:20,051
When it's fully absorbed,

224
00:16:21,004 --> 00:16:22,019
you will reach Illusory Yin.

225
00:16:23,012 --> 00:16:23,093
That day

226
00:16:24,052 --> 00:16:25,084
may come sooner or later.

227
00:16:25,092 --> 00:16:27,044
Success lies in perseverance.

228
00:16:29,028 --> 00:16:30,061
I'm returning what belongs to you.

229
00:16:34,056 --> 00:16:35,037
Keep them safe.

230
00:16:35,072 --> 00:16:37,007
These artifacts and celestial jades

231
00:16:37,028 --> 00:16:38,065
will also help your cultivation.

232
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:42,038
This is a Restriction-Breaking Ancient Mirror,

233
00:16:41,028 --> 00:16:44,024
Restriction-Breaking\NAncient Mirror

234
00:16:42,044 --> 00:16:44,004
there are very few of these left.

235
00:16:44,052 --> 00:16:46,027
If you ever need to break a restriction quickly,

236
00:16:46,076 --> 00:16:48,027
it may be of help to you.

237
00:16:49,088 --> 00:16:51,015
I can no longer see through

238
00:16:51,072 --> 00:16:52,091
Brother Xu's cultivation.

239
00:16:54,012 --> 00:16:55,079
As for slaying that Immortal...

240
00:16:57,036 --> 00:16:59,017
It was only possible thanks to Brother Li's restrictions.

241
00:16:59,032 --> 00:17:00,063
Although the Blood Ancestor isn't dead yet,

242
00:17:01,044 --> 00:17:02,059
he no longer poses a threat.

243
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:04,030
Brother Li,

244
00:17:05,020 --> 00:17:07,024
I wish to go to a place called the Collection Pavilion

245
00:17:07,028 --> 00:17:08,052
