251
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:23,052
Celestial Guiding Palace\NThunder Celestial Realm

252
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:22,011
Brother Xu,

253
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:24,024
The Collection Pavilion is to the southwest

254
00:17:24,028 --> 00:17:26,008
and there are several ancient Celestial ruins nearby.

255
00:17:26,016 --> 00:17:27,036
Do you want to explore them too ?

256
00:17:27,084 --> 00:17:29,045
If Brother Li thinks they're worth visiting,

257
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:30,084
then the more opportunities,

258
00:17:30,092 --> 00:17:31,095
the better.

259
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:38,075
This rundown place

260
00:17:38,008 --> 00:17:40,060
Celestial Welcoming\NPalace

261
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,031
