262
00:17:41,044 --> 00:17:42,079
What's there to look around for ?

263
00:17:43,036 --> 00:17:44,064
This Celestial Welcoming Palace

264
00:17:45,032 --> 00:17:46,099
seems to be a place where ancient Celestials traded.

265
00:17:47,064 --> 00:17:48,096
Brother Xu's guess is right.

266
00:17:49,056 --> 00:17:50,059
According to ancient records,

267
00:17:50,096 --> 00:17:52,016
in these kinds of Celestial markets,

268
00:17:52,036 --> 00:17:53,091
the largest shop is always to the east.

269
00:18:04,004 --> 00:18:05,067
My Divine Sense found nothing unusual.

270
00:18:07,044 --> 00:18:08,003
See ?

271
00:18:08,068 --> 00:18:09,079
Not even a single hair left.

272
00:18:12,064 --> 00:18:13,007
Brother Xu,

273
00:18:13,064 --> 00:18:15,040
please strike this spot with full force.

274
00:18:22,056 --> 00:18:24,047
There really was a hidden formation.

275
00:18:25,088 --> 00:18:27,047
It's a pity this formation is too old,

276
00:18:28,012 --> 00:18:29,047
its celestial spiritual energy is gone,

277
00:18:29,072 --> 00:18:30,063
it's a dead formation.

278
00:18:32,024 --> 00:18:32,072
Not bad.

